@{ Layout = null; }
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><title>Area comparison &middot; Pakistan Crop Statistics</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.css")" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-atlas.css")" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-theme.css")" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-editorial.css")" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-shell.css")" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-imagery.css")" /></head>
<body id="page-top" class="crop-shell area-dashboard area-comparison" data-page="areaCompare" data-api="@Url.Action("Explore", "Crops")" data-root="@Url.Content("~/")" style="--page-harvest-image: url('@Url.Content("~/Content/images/pakistan-area-profile-banner.png")')">
@Html.Partial("_CropNavigation")
<main class="workspace" id="main-content">
<button id="menu-toggle" class="shell-icon-button dashboard-menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-controls="crop-navigation" aria-expanded="false"><svg class="shell-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-icons.svg#shell-menu")"></use></svg></button>
<section class="hero harvest-hero"><img class="harvest-photo" src="@Url.Content("~/Content/images/pakistan-area-profile-banner.png")" alt="Pakistan's irrigated agricultural landscape" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">AREA COMPARISON &middot; ALL CROPS</p><h1>Two places.<br />A clearer perspective.</h1><p class="hero-deck">Compare the crops, the harvests, and the progress.</p><p id="intro">Put two areas at the same geographic level side by side. Discover shared strengths and different trajectories.</p><div class="hero-tags"><span>Same-level comparison</span><span>All reported crops</span><span>Yield &amp; growth</span></div></div><div class="hero-stamp"><small>ALL REPORTED CROPS</small><span id="hero-year">&mdash;</span><small>FISCAL YEAR</small></div></section>
<nav class="section-nav" aria-label="Page sections"><a href="#comparison-section">Compare the harvest</a><a href="#trends-section">Compare progress</a><a href="#map-section">View both areas</a><a href="#data-section">Explore differences</a></nav>
<section class="filters comparison-filters" aria-label="Area comparison filters"><label>Geographic level<select id="compare-level"><option value="province">Provinces</option><option value="division">Divisions</option><option value="district">Districts</option></select></label><label class="compare-label-a">Area A<select id="area-a"></select></label><button class="quiet" type="button" id="swap" aria-label="Swap comparison areas">&harr;</button><label class="compare-label-b">Area B<select id="area-b"></select></label><label>Fiscal year<select id="year"></select></label></section>
<div id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading area comparison...</div>
<section class="comparison-context"><div class="comparison-area comparison-area-a"><span class="comparison-badge">A</span><div><small id="level-a">AREA A</small><h2 id="name-a">&mdash;</h2></div><a id="profile-a" class="quiet">Open profile &nearr;</a></div><span class="comparison-versus">vs</span><div class="comparison-area comparison-area-b"><span class="comparison-badge">B</span><div><small id="level-b">AREA B</small><h2 id="name-b">&mdash;</h2></div><a id="profile-b" class="quiet">Open profile &nearr;</a></div></section>
<section id="cards" class="cards" aria-label="Comparative indicators"></section><section id="insights" class="insights" aria-label="Quick comparative insights"></section>
<section id="comparison-section" class="grid"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CULTIVATION COMPOSITION</p><h2>What each area grows</h2></div></div><div id="mix-chart" class="chart tall"></div><p class="panel-note">Share of reported crop area in each region. Twelve crops with the largest combined reported area are shown. Cultivation area does not represent unique land.</p></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE RELATIVE HARVEST</p><h2>Production, crop by crop</h2></div></div><div id="production-chart" class="chart tall"></div><p class="panel-note">For each shared crop, bars show each area's share of their combined production. Crop-specific source units are preserved; different crops are not added together.</p></article></section>
<section id="trends-section" class="grid"><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRODUCTIVITY DIFFERENCES</p><h2>Where yields differ</h2></div></div><div id="yield-gap-chart" class="chart tall"></div><p class="panel-note">A's yield compared with B's for the same crop. Positive values favor A; negative values favor B. Only complete measurements and positive comparison yields are included.</p></article><article class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YEAR-ON-YEAR MOMENTUM</p><h2>How crop yields are changing</h2></div></div><div id="growth-chart" class="chart tall"></div><p class="panel-note">Each area's yield change from the preceding fiscal year, compared crop by crop.</p></article></section>
<section class="panel" id="history-section"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW BOTH TRAJECTORIES</p><h2>Progress through the years</h2></div><select id="history-metric" aria-label="History measurement"><option value="Yield">Yield</option><option value="Production">Production</option><option value="Area">Cultivation area</option></select></div><div id="history-charts" class="comparison-history"></div><p class="panel-note">Six shared crops with the largest combined reported cultivation area. Each chart compares the same crop in its own source units; missing observations remain gaps.</p></section>
<section id="map-section" class="grid comparison-maps"><article class="panel map-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">AREA A</p><h2 id="map-name-a">Area A</h2></div><span class="comparison-badge">A</span></div><div id="map-a" class="comparison-map" aria-label="Area A crop diversity map"></div><div class="map-foot"><span id="map-description-a">Crop diversity</span><div id="legend-a" class="comparison-legend"></div></div><div id="map-stats-a" class="comparison-map-stats"></div></article><article class="panel map-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">AREA B</p><h2 id="map-name-b">Area B</h2></div><span class="comparison-badge comparison-badge-b">B</span></div><div id="map-b" class="comparison-map" aria-label="Area B crop diversity map"></div><div class="map-foot"><span id="map-description-b">Crop diversity</span><div id="legend-b" class="comparison-legend"></div></div><div id="map-stats-b" class="comparison-map-stats"></div></article></section>
<section id="data-section" class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EVERY CROP, SIDE BY SIDE</p><h2>Comparison detail</h2></div><div class="table-tools"><input id="search" type="search" aria-label="Find a crop" placeholder="Find a crop..." /><select id="table-metric" aria-label="Table measurement"><option value="Production">Production</option><option value="Area">Cultivation area</option><option value="Yield">Yield</option></select><button id="table-download" class="button" type="button">Download CSV</button></div></div><div class="table-scroll"><table id="data-table"><thead></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div><div class="table-footer"><span id="table-count"></span><span>All reported crops &middot; differences use A minus B</span></div></section>
@Html.Partial("_CropFooter")
</main><script src="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/vendor/leaflet/leaflet.js")"></script><script src="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/vendor/highcharts/highcharts.js")"></script><script src="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/vendor/highcharts/accessibility.js")"></script><script src="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/crop-shell.js")"></script><script src="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/crop-area-comparison.js")"></script></body></html>
